py-d08-standardize~1.solution:
def min_max(X):
    X = np.asarray(X, dtype=float)
    lo = X.min(axis=0)
    rng = X.max(axis=0) - lo
    safe = np.where(rng == 0, 1.0, rng)
    return np.where(rng == 0, 0.0, (X - lo) / safe)


def flag_high(X, t):
    return min_max(X) > t

py-d08-standardize~2.solution:
def col_share(X):
    X = np.asarray(X, dtype=float)
    tot = X.sum(axis=0)
    safe = np.where(tot == 0, 1.0, tot)
    return np.where(tot == 0, 0.0, X / safe)


def flag_big(X, s):
    return col_share(X) > s

